// Let unattended-upgrades install updates from the Citronics APT repository:
// kernels, firmware, the Limeboard tools and the patched ModemManager. The
// repository is matched by its host: its Release files carry no Origin, and
// adding one now would make every device's apt refuse the repository as
// changed. The experimental component is only seen by boards that opted in.
Unattended-Upgrade::Origins-Pattern {
	"site=citronics.github.io";
};
